{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟行政總裁薩提亞·納德拉近日表示，隨着人工智能代理（AI Agents）能力不斷增強，互聯網的經濟運行方式可能迎來深刻調整。未來，越來越多用户將通過AI代理獲取信息、完成任務和進行在線交易，而不是像過去那樣直接訪問網站，這將促使整個網絡生態重新思考價值分配模式。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587032.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:12:32.437987+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T02:54:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T03:05:54.330309+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:05:54.330309+00:00","content_hash":"878733cd00d641b208e52e235162be60507de4d88121f6c25c7203482d236370","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}